-- REQIUREMENTS --

It is recommended to learn these things before starting these challenges:

1. Learn what headers do.
2. Learn the int main() function
3. Learn how to use printf()
4. Learn basic variable types--int, float, double, char, bool, and strings
5. Learn format specifiers for all of the above variables
6. Learn how to use scanf()
7. Learn how to use if, else if, and else statements
8. Learn how to use for and while loops
9. Learn how to use switches

